<p style="margin: 0;">Dear customer,<br><br>
								  Thank you for choosing us to allocate <strong> {Product}</strong> vouchers to your employees. Please find <strong>attached your contract</strong> in PDF format.</p><br/>
<p style="margin: 0;"><span style="color: #ff0d84; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 140%; text-align: center;"> Now you've registered,
 <strong>it's time to place your first Edenred Meal Order !</strong></span>
 <br> </br>
</p>
<p style="margin: 0;"><span style="color: #162056; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px;">Place your order now</span><br></p>

<p> Go to <strong>your MyEdenred.lu employer area</strong> to place your order</p>

<p><strong style="color:#0085CA; font-size: 15px;">If you have a trustee, an accountant or a payroll service provider</strong><br/>
			Be sure to contact them to make sure they have all the necessary information about your employees and to place your order</p>

</td>
